<ModMetaData>
    <name>Music Expanded: Baldur's Gate 3</name>
    <description><![CDATA[ Once again you have drifted into the affairs of Gods and Mortals and found it to be way more fun to hit on a vampire twink than a sad wizard. This was a quick job I wanted which would allow some people to listen to the fun music that Larian made for Baldur's Gate 3.

    Tracks: A Threat from Nether Years, Bard Dance, Cunning Cruel Crits, Down by the River, Dream Walk Instrumental, Elder Brain, Forging the Fate, Gather Your Allies!, Harpy Song, I Want to Live (Original, Classical, Instrumental), Last Light, Last Shelter, Lead Your Fights, Lead Your Way, Main Theme Part 1-3, Mind Flayer Theme, Nightsong, Nine Blades, Old Time Battles (Part 1-2, Bard), Quest for a Cure, Raphael's Final Act, Shadows, Curse, and Death, Sixteen Strikes, Song of Balduran, Surgery of a Hope, The Colors of Underdark, The Cult of the Absolute, The Grand Design Requiem, The Legacy of Bhaal, The Odds are Cast Anew, The Power (Choral, Credits, Orchestral), The Road to Baldur's Gate, Twisted Force, Weeping Down, Who are You?
]]>
    </description>
